H5517.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esdras 2:44; also called Sia at Néhémie 7:47; 
§ Sia or Siaha = "departing"
ancestor of a family of temple slaves who returned from exile with Zerubbabel

H5540.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:30; 
son of: Nadab (H5070I); 
brother of: Appaim (H0649) 
§ Seled = "exultation"
one of the sons of Nadab, a descendant of Jerahmeel

H5543A.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Néhémie 11:8; also translated "valor"; 
§ Sallu or Salu or Sallai = "weighed"
a Benjamite

H5565.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 26:7; 
son of: Shemaiah (H8098I); 
brother of: Othni (H6273), Rephael (H7501), Obed (H5744J), Elzabad (H0443H) and Elihu (H0453I) 
§ Semachiah = "Jehovah has sustained"
a Korahite Levite, one of the sons of Shemaiah

H5576.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 18:13; 
father of: Adrammelech (H0152H), Sharezer (H8272) and Esarhaddon (H0634); also called Sargon at Ésaïe 20:1;
Also named: sar.gon (סַרְגוֹן "Sargon" H5623) 
§ Sennacherib = "Sin multiplied brothers" (Sin = the moon)
son of Sargon, father of Esarhaddon, and king of Assyria from 705-681 BC; attacked Judah during the reign of king Hezekiah and Judah was delivered when in response to the prayer of Hezekiah an angel smote 185,000 Assyrian soldiers

H5581.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:40; 
son of: Eleasah (H0501); 
father of: Shallum (H7967I) 
§ Sisamai = "water crane" or "swallow"
a descendant of Sheshan in the line of Jerahmeel

H5593.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 21:18; 
son of: Rapha (H7497A); 
brother of: Goliath (H1555), Ishbi-benob (H3430) , Lahmi (H3902), huge_man (H4060A); also called Sippai at 1 Chroniques 20:4;
Also named: sip.pay (סִפַּי "Sippai" H5598) 
§ Saph = "tall"
one of the sons of the Philistine giant slain by Sibbechai the Hushathite

H5598.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 21:18; 
son of: Rapha (H7497A); 
brother of: Goliath (H1555), Ishbi-benob (H3430) , Lahmi (H3902), huge_man (H4060A); also called Sippai at 1 Chroniques 20:4;
Another name of saph (סַף "Saph" H5593) 
§ Sippai = "threshold"
one of the sons of the Philistine giant slain by Sibbechai the Hushathite
